# マイクロカード (design 11.18), for tools/ui_run.py: the template カード用紙 opened on
# 設計画面, three fields named (one made a number of 3 digits), the cards typed in
# through かな漢字変換, a card added and one duplicated, a mark, the list window
# following the card shown; 検索条件画面: a new search with <, a narrowing with
# ≒, a regular expression; 並べ替え and 重複検索 from the menu; 表示設定; saved,
# closed and opened again. Then the sample 住所録: ≒ finding katakana by hiragana,
# 差し込み into the label layout and the letter, and the found cards written out
# in @形式. The card window is at 120,90 (its work area from 131,118), the
# list window right of it.
# A search's note comes before the screen is changed and the bar along the
# top made again, so a press on the bar waits for "bar <screen> search
# <on|off>", which the program says once the bar's buttons are in place;
# a note said more than once is looked for after a logmark.
open 01a0d8c4-5334-7e95-8a06-b1c2d3e4f534
expect mcard: ready カード用紙
wait 800
win カード用紙
# 設計画面: なまえ, ねんれい (a number of 3), でんわ
